test/fixtures/monid/litescrape-reviews-oishii.json | high-entropy | * | synthetic Google review ids, review links and a pagination token in the litescrape shape
test/fixtures/monid/litescrape-reviews-tartine.json | high-entropy | * | synthetic Google review ids, review links and a pagination token in the litescrape shape
test/guarded-connect-proxy.test.mjs | private-ip | * | the proxy must refuse each private range
test/guarded-connect-proxy.test.mjs | public-ip | * | X.509 OIDs in the TLS fixture and sample addresses of a public host
domain/dish-photos-generic.json | vietnamese | * | generic menu words in several languages, matched against real menus
domain/dish-photos.mjs | vietnamese | * | Vietnamese negation, comparison and side-dish words read in real posts
test/brief-research-dish-photos.test.mjs | vietnamese | * | real Vietnamese dish names as input
test/domain-agent-prompt-dish-photos.test.mjs | vietnamese | * | real Vietnamese dish names as input
